      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The creek begins just below the Mogollon Rim with a perennial spring, and rain and snow melt keep it flowing during dry months.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
