      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haigler_Creek%2C_Arizona",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Arizona Game and Fish Department stocks Haigler Creek with Rainbow and Brown trout, while native species also thrive there.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haigler_Creek%2C_Arizona",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "At 5,240 feet, Haigler Creek sits within Tonto National Forest, just 11 miles south of Route 260.",
